OL,3,APresidential villa also hit by water
OL,4,Aand power cuts, Nigerian leader says
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigeria's President Bola Tinubu says
OL,7,Fthe presidential villa suffers from
OL,8,Fcuts in electricity and water -
OL,9,Ffailures that plague ordinary citizens.
OL,11,FHe said he was shaving last week when
OL,12,Fthe water supply at the villa, known as
OL,13,FAso Rock, in Abuja cut.
OL,15,FHe is seeking re-election next January
OL,16,Fand vowed to address these issues..
OL,18,FTinubu made the disclosure on Sunday at
OL,19,Fa special prayer session organised in
OL,20,Fhis honour by members of his family in
OL,21,FLagos.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
